Package: actions-runner-processor
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Depends: bubblewrap, fuse-overlayfs, ${misc:Depends}
Description: GitHub Actions self-hosted runner processor for Linux VMs
 A lightweight, single-binary GitHub Actions self-hosted runner processor
 for homelab Linux VMs. It uses the actions/scaleset Message Session API
 (the same protocol as ARC) to detect queued jobs and launch ephemeral
 runners inside bubblewrap sandboxes.
 .
 Go modules are vendored (see vendor/) so the package builds on Launchpad
 buildd hosts, which have no network access. Bump the golang-1.26-go
 version in Build-Depends together with the go directive in go.mod.
